<p>Upon activation summon a Temporal Hound.  Every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">53, 34, 26, 21, 18</acronym> turns another hound will be summoned, up to a maximum of three hounds. If a hound dies you'll summon a new hound in <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">53, 34, 26, 21, 18</acronym> turns.  </p><p>Your hounds inherit your increased damage percent, have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 11%, 15%, 19%, 21%</acronym> physical resistance and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 46%, 63%, 77%, 87%</acronym> temporal resistance, and are immune to teleportation effects.</p><p>Hounds will get, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Strength, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Dexterity, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Constitution, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Magic, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Willpower, and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">62, 78, 89, 99, 107</acronym> Cunning, based on your Magic stat.</p>